<title>USA: Saba Petroleum sets 2-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Saba Petroleum sets 2-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saba Petroleum Co said Thursday it is instituting a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the split was approved by the company in the form of a 100 percent common stock dividend to be distributed December 16 to shareholders of record on December 9.</p>
<p>As a result of the split the company's total common shares outstanding will increase from 4.6 million to 9.2 million.</p>
</text>
